<title>USA: Medquist says CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Medquist says CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>MARLTON, N.J. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medquist Inc said that Robert Graham, its chief financial officer, has resigned to pursue a job as chief financial officer with an emerging company.</p>
<p>Medquist did not say which company Graham was joining.</p>
<p>Medquist provides electronic transcription and document management services to the healthcare industry.</p>
</text>
